  "details": "When trying to make an earring for my avatar, I encountered an issue where the earring's physbone's gravity value pulls in the Local Y vector, as opposed to the intended Global Y vector. The ear which the earring and physbone are attached to has its own physbone, which is also subject to gravity but with gravity falloff enabled. Neither the ear nor the earring have physbone limits. This issue occurs both in the Unity play-mode editor and vrchat itself.",
